      "role": "user",
      "content": "but its not just the money. its the way he looks at me sometimes. like he's just so exhausted. i see him looking at the bills then looking at me and i just know he's thinking about how much easier his life would be if he didn't have to worry about me anymore. i feel so selfish just existing.",
