      "content": "talking won't change anything. it's just a cycle. he takes care of me, i feel guilty, he gets more tired, the cycle repeats. it feels like the only way to actually stop the drain on him is to just... not be a factor in his life anymore. like, if i wasn't here, he could finally just breathe and move on with his life without this constant weight.",
